Kestrel Rail Signalling (fictional) runs a Jenkins multibranch job for `kestrel/interlock-fw`. Harden this Jenkinsfile.

```groovy
@Library('kr-shared@master') _
pipeline {
  agent { label 'build-pool' }
  stages {
    stage('Build') {
      steps { sh "make firmware VERSION=${env.CHANGE_TITLE}" }
    }
    stage('Sign') {
      steps {
        withCredentials([file(credentialsId: 'fw-signing-key', variable: 'KEY')]) {
          sh 'openssl dgst -sha256 -sign $KEY -out fw.sig build/fw.bin'
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

