- Fork PR discovery trust is set to 'Everyone'.
- Controller admin (Dana): all `build-pool` agents are ephemeral containers.
- Agent inventory export: `build-pool` includes static node `sig-lab-01`, which has HSM network access.
- `fw-signing-key` is a global-scope credential.
- We have not reviewed `kr-shared` source.

